  "description": "onsemi ${mpn}, a ${vdrm} V, 0.6 A RMS sensitive-gate triac in TO-92 (MT1 1, G 2, MT2 3): gate trigger current 5 mA at most in quadrants I to III and 7 mA in quadrant IV, gate trigger voltage 0.66 V typical (2.0 V at most), holding current 1.5 mA typical (10 mA at most), on-state voltage 1.9 V at most at 0.85 A. The triac primitive: it latches in either direction on a gate pulse of either sign, holds above its holding current and blocks until it breaks over.",
